<title>UK: UPS sets 100 million stg 3-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>UPS sets 100 million stg 3-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER    UNITED PARCEL SERVICE OF AMERICA INC</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   COUPON     6.875     MATURITY    25.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.0775  PAY DATE    25.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.89     SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  U.S	 TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
